01:03:29.180 --> 01:03:32.599
who might've noticed something suspicious?


01:03:32.684 --> 01:03:34.268
Well, I think your best bet


01:03:34.352 --> 01:03:36.645
might be to go over there to the bar
and talk to the bartender.


01:03:36.730 --> 01:03:38.856
He knows most everybody
coming in and outta here.


01:03:38.940 --> 01:03:41.066
And the regulars, they're alWays around.


01:03:41.151 --> 01:03:42.443
Okay.


01:03:42.527 --> 01:03:44.069
* Yeah, yeah *


01:04:21.107 --> 01:04:23.150
Excuse me, ma'am.


01:04:23.234 --> 01:04:25.194
- Yeah.
- Excuse me, ma'am.


01:04:25.278 --> 01:04:26.695
What can I do for you...


01:04:26.780 --> 01:04:31.116
Officer Finley Sterling?


01:04:31.201 --> 01:04:32.368
Is that a real name?


01:04:32.452 --> 01:04:36.121
Some of my friends call me Yale,
if that makes things easier for you.


01:04:36.206 --> 01:04:39.625
We're just looking for a truck driver
with a little girl with him.


01:04:41.044 --> 01:04:43.462
About five foot tall.


01:04:44.464 --> 01:04:47.174
Dark broWn hair.
You seen anybody like that?


01:04:50.303 --> 01:04:51.678
Nope.


01:04:51.763 --> 01:04:53.222
Okay, thank you. Have a good night.


01:04:54.224 --> 01:04:55.224
And you.


01:05:26.631 --> 01:05:28.132
Sally.


01:05:39.394 --> 01:05:40.686
- Hey.
- I'm okay.


01:05:40.770 --> 01:05:42.354
- You okay?
- Good.


01:05:42.439 --> 01:05:44.815
Okay.
Do you live around here?


01:05:44.899 --> 01:05:46.942
No?


01:05:47.026 --> 01:05:48.110
What's your name?


01:05:49.487 --> 01:05:51.822
Okay. Let's get you
back to your truck, okay?


01:05:51.906 --> 01:05:53.991
- Yeah.
- You think you can show us the Way?


01:05:56.828 --> 01:06:00.497
Oh. Watch your step, hon.


01:06:00.582 --> 01:06:02.791
Had a little too much
to drink tonight?


01:06:02.876 --> 01:06:05.627
Happens to the best of us, right?


01:06:20.226 --> 01:06:21.935
Which one's your truck?


01:06:23.354 --> 01:06:24.354
Is it this one?


01:06:24.439 --> 01:06:25.981
All right, let's get your keys.


01:06:26.065 --> 01:06:27.774
Where's your keys?


01:06:31.446 --> 01:06:33.572
- Watch her, Tesz.
- You got it.


01:06:39.204 --> 01:06:41.413
- There's no one in here.
- What?


01:06:41.498 --> 01:06:43.165
I'm sayin'
there's no fucking girl in here.


01:06:43.249 --> 01:06:45.667
Oh, fuck. Where is she?


01:06:47.378 --> 01:06:50.088
I said, Where the fuck is the girl?


01:06:50.173 --> 01:06:51.465
What a dump.


01:06:51.549 --> 01:06:53.050
There's nothing in here but crap.


01:06:53.134 --> 01:06:54.843
What? Are you sure?


01:06:57.347 --> 01:06:59.014
What is all this shit?


01:06:59.098 --> 01:07:01.725
- What the hell is this?
- Where's the girl?


01:07:04.812 --> 01:07:05.979
Where the fuck is the girl?


01:07:06.064 --> 01:07:07.898
- I don't- I don't know.
- Wake up, wake up.


01:07:07.982 --> 01:07:09.858
Wake up, get up.


01:07:09.943 --> 01:07:13.570
Show me where-


01:07:19.285 --> 01:07:21.036
Oh, shit!


01:07:23.248 --> 01:07:26.375
- What the fuck?
- She's shot a guy before.


01:07:28.002 --> 01:07:31.547
Hey, Deborah. Get out here.


01:07:32.799 --> 01:07:34.758
What the fuck, Tesz?


01:07:34.842 --> 01:07:36.677
Shit.


01:07:37.679 --> 01:07:39.721
Hey, what's going on out there?


01:07:40.932 --> 01:07:42.683
Shut the fuck up!
I'm tryin' to sleep!


01:07:42.767 --> 01:07:44.184
Come on, Sally.


01:07:44.269 --> 01:07:46.103
Get in the truck.


01:07:47.105 --> 01:07:48.021
Here.


01:07:50.149 --> 01:07:52.401
- Come on! Get in the truck!
- She's got a gun.


01:07:52.485 --> 01:07:53.944
Hey, careful.


01:07:56.573 --> 01:07:59.157
I'm tired of this shit.
Tryin' to sleep over here.


01:08:03.079 --> 01:08:04.162
Get the fuck outta here!


01:08:04.247 --> 01:08:05.372
You fucked up my eye, bitch.


01:08:05.456 --> 01:08:07.165
- Fuck you!
- Shut the fuck-


01:08:08.251 --> 01:08:09.876
Hey!


01:08:09.961 --> 01:08:11.545
Get the car, get the car.


01:08:20.888 --> 01:08:22.139
- Straight out.
- Yeah.


01:08:25.810 --> 01:08:28.520
- What the fuck?
- Is that her truck?


01:08:40.617 --> 01:08:43.118
- What the fuck?
- Is she gonna fucking hit us?


01:08:59.093 --> 01:09:00.636
Keep her there. Hold her.


01:09:03.139 --> 01:09:04.473
Again.


01:09:13.107 --> 01:09:14.900
- We need to talk to her.
- Her?


01:09:18.571 --> 01:09:21.365
It's a blue cab truck. Keep it in sight.


01:09:25.536 --> 01:09:27.079
- You get the plates?
- Yeah.


01:09:30.458 --> 01:09:32.292
- All right.
- No!


01:09:32.377 --> 01:09:34.461
- Wait. What the fuck are you doing?
- She's getting away!


01:09:34.545 --> 01:09:36.880
We don't wanna get
into a fucking car chase with the police!


01:09:47.558 --> 01:09:48.850
Calm down, all right?


01:09:48.935 --> 01:09:50.602
I don't Want you to hurt yourself.


01:10:10.832 --> 01:10:12.124
Pull it right here.


01:10:13.251 --> 01:10:14.251
Pull right.


01:10:19.424 --> 01:10:20.632
Straighten out!


01:11:23.237 --> 01:11:24.321
Fuck!


01:12:39.063 --> 01:12:40.105
In other news,


01:12:40.189 --> 01:12:44.109
the police are still on the lookout
for a light blue Peterbilt truck


01:12:44.193 --> 01:12:47.445
after the incident at Sherrigan's truck
stop last night.


01:12:47.530 --> 01:12:50.365
License plate F-3-1-


01:13:00.793 --> 01:13:03.044
- We should get going.
- Oh, no.


01:13:05.381 --> 01:13:07.007
Right.


01:13:09.343 --> 01:13:11.303
Can We go to this place?


01:13:14.348 --> 01:13:16.266
It's not far from here.


01:13:18.227 --> 01:13:19.895
I just wanna pick up my jacket.


01:13:26.193 --> 01:13:28.194
There ain't nobody there, so...


01:13:30.281 --> 01:13:31.531
no one's gonna see us.


01:13:33.534 --> 01:13:37.120
HoW the hell can they be lost, man?
They're in a blue rig!


01:13:38.164 --> 01:13:39.998
Kinda hard to miss.


01:13:40.082 --> 01:13:42.959
All the roads around here
aren't even on the map, sir.


01:13:43.044 --> 01:13:45.754
Well, get a chopper in the air,
man, for fuck's sake.


01:13:45.838 --> 01:13:47.756
You think we got a chopper around here?


01:13:47.840 --> 01:13:51.301
Get a neWs chopper, I don't care!
Weather chopper!


01:13:51.385 --> 01:13:53.470
- What?
- She's ready to talk.


01:13:57.725 --> 01:14:00.268
You know, sometimes people help you more
if you're not an asshole.


01:14:00.353 --> 01:14:02.896
- I'm only an asshole to you.
- You're an asshole to everyone.


01:14:02.980 --> 01:14:04.522
And you.


01:14:04.607 --> 01:14:07.442
I don't work for nobody, sir.


01:14:07.526 --> 01:14:09.486
Some woman
asked if We wanted some cash.


01:14:09.570 --> 01:14:13.114
I don't knoW the bitch.
Don't know the trucker lady.


01:14:13.199 --> 01:14:15.784
And don't know the girl
who took a swing at me.


01:14:15.868 --> 01:14:17.577
The girl took a swing at you?


01:14:17.662 --> 01:14:20.956
Yeah. She was the one
holding the gun, too.


01:14:28.297 --> 01:14:31.675
You'll like our trailer. It's nice.


01:14:35.096 --> 01:14:38.807
Our trailer is bright blue,
so you'll knoW it when you see it.


01:14:40.184 --> 01:14:41.559
My mom painted it.


01:14:47.191 --> 01:14:48.650
Your friend Cooper's place?


01:14:51.112 --> 01:14:53.822
Yeah. That was his place.


01:14:56.450 --> 01:14:58.243
Our trailer- our trailer's
right behind the pink flamingo,


01:14:58.327 --> 01:14:59.995
so you'll see it in just a second.


01:15:24.854 --> 01:15:27.105
It was just prescriptions at first.


01:15:31.027 --> 01:15:34.070
She only took what the fucking
doctor told her to take.


01:15:43.414 --> 01:15:46.332
I didn't wanna stay
at another group home.


01:15:49.545 --> 01:15:51.129
So I ran.


01:16:15.112 --> 01:16:16.696
My mom loved me.


01:16:26.540 --> 01:16:29.042
But that stuff made her happy every time.


01:16:46.811 --> 01:16:50.605
Me, I've never actually been
to the ocean before.


01:16:57.321 --> 01:16:59.864
Well, you're lucky
to know where you wanna go.


01:17:01.867 --> 01:17:03.993
I only know what I'm running from.


01:17:15.131 --> 01:17:16.131
You're out?


01:17:16.215 --> 01:17:18.383
Yeah. Finally.


01:17:18.467 --> 01:17:21.427
- You're at the house?
- Yeah. Yeah, I'm home.


01:17:21.512 --> 01:17:23.179
I thought you'd be here already.


01:17:23.264 --> 01:17:26.307
I'm so nervous, Sal,
about the girl, you know?


01:17:26.392 --> 01:17:30.061
We gotta get her to them tonight.
They're gonna let me know what time.


01:17:30.146 --> 01:17:32.480
You promise me you'll get her home.


01:17:32.565 --> 01:17:35.316
Oh, shit... They're-they're
calling me again.


01:17:35.401 --> 01:17:36.901
Sal, I-


01:17:50.624 --> 01:17:53.376
Dad used to beat us, and...


01:17:53.460 --> 01:17:57.130
Dennis took the brunt of it
for as long as he could to protect me.


01:17:57.214 --> 01:18:01.217
And it- it hurt him.
It carved a piece out of him.


01:18:04.930 --> 01:18:07.557
It's my turn
to take care of him this time.


01:18:20.988 --> 01:18:22.530
Joining conference now.


01:18:22.615 --> 01:18:26.075
Welcome, Sally.
Didn't think you'd make it on here today.


01:18:26.160 --> 01:18:27.827
How was it, pickin' up your brother?


01:18:27.912 --> 01:18:31.497
Hey, ladies. I got a favor to ask you.


01:18:31.582 --> 01:18:34.167
No way! Did he fuck up already?


01:18:34.251 --> 01:18:36.419
It's not for my brother. It's for me.


01:18:42.259 --> 01:18:45.261
The truck's been sighted!
Positive match on the plates!


01:19:42.152 --> 01:19:43.319
Step out of the vehicle, ma'am.


01:19:43.404 --> 01:19:45.822
This a vehicle inspection, sir?


01:19:45.906 --> 01:19:47.657
Please step out, ma'am.


01:19:47.741 --> 01:19:48.825
All right.


01:19:58.544 --> 01:20:00.044
CDL, please.


01:20:02.006 --> 01:20:03.298
FolloW me.


01:21:49.863 --> 01:21:51.322
Give me a moment, will ya?


01:21:57.037 --> 01:21:58.871
All right if I call you Sally?


01:22:01.625 --> 01:22:03.292
We're looking for a young girl.


01:22:04.920 --> 01:22:06.087
Dark hair.


01:22:07.381 --> 01:22:10.049
Thought you might've seen her.


01:22:10.134 --> 01:22:13.386
You and your partner asked around the bar
at Sherrigan's last night.


01:22:14.388 --> 01:22:15.930
I haven't seen her, sir.


01:22:18.016 --> 01:22:20.601
What happened to your face?


01:22:20.686 --> 01:22:22.854
Didn't I tell you
I Was at the bar last night?


01:22:22.938 --> 01:22:25.398
Oh.


01:22:25.482 --> 01:22:28.025
And it looks like your truck
took a beating for ya.


01:22:29.653 --> 01:22:31.362
Was she there, too?


01:22:31.447 --> 01:22:36.451
You know it, sir. She and me, we're one.


01:22:38.078 --> 01:22:39.454
Where are you from?


01:22:40.706 --> 01:22:43.499
NoWhere, and everywhere.


01:22:44.501 --> 01:22:46.294
That's America for you.


01:22:47.504 --> 01:22:49.422
But you've been here a long time.


01:22:52.718 --> 01:22:54.010
Where do you live?


01:22:55.304 --> 01:22:57.388
Right here, sir, in my truck.


01:22:57.473 --> 01:23:02.685
I hear ya.
My car often becomes my bed.


01:23:02.769 --> 01:23:03.811
I don't mind.


01:23:05.063 --> 01:23:06.481
Solitude is nice.


01:23:07.691 --> 01:23:11.611
Well, sorry to bother you.
Have a nice ride.


01:23:11.695 --> 01:23:12.737
Oh...


01:23:15.032 --> 01:23:16.574
Where you headed?


01:23:16.658 --> 01:23:18.201
Across the river.


01:23:18.285 --> 01:23:20.119
- Arkansas?
- Arkansas.


01:23:20.204 --> 01:23:21.579
I figured.


01:23:24.583 --> 01:23:26.751
Look, Sally...


01:23:26.835 --> 01:23:31.339
there are some bad people out,
wantin' to hurt that girl.


01:23:31.423 --> 01:23:33.674
The police are looking for a killer.


01:23:33.759 --> 01:23:36.093
That's not What I'm after.


01:23:36.178 --> 01:23:39.639
I just want to help her and whoever's
trying to be good to her.


01:23:39.723 --> 01:23:40.723
You understand?


01:23:43.018 --> 01:23:45.394
Here. This is my number.


01:23:47.856 --> 01:23:50.191
I don't trust the system
any more than you do...


01:23:51.652 --> 01:23:53.694
but some of us are not all bad.


01:23:54.696 --> 01:23:55.780
Okay?


01:23:57.282 --> 01:24:00.743
All right. Well, have a nice ride.


01:24:22.307 --> 01:24:23.724
Yeah.


01:24:28.230 --> 01:24:30.064
You wanna tell me
what you're not telling them?


01:24:32.734 --> 01:24:35.069
She's with the girl all right.


01:24:35.153 --> 01:24:38.573
But that lady trucker's
not who We're looking for.


01:24:38.657 --> 01:24:40.908
I think the girl Was safe here With her.


01:24:40.993 --> 01:24:45.162
Last thing We need is a bunch of cops
running after them with guns drawn.


01:24:46.748 --> 01:24:49.500
Oh, we'll keep an eye on her.


01:24:49.585 --> 01:24:52.503
Let her guide us to whoever
she's running away from.


01:24:54.590 --> 01:24:57.216
See, people are more helpful
if you're not an asshole.


01:25:00.262 --> 01:25:01.387
Yeah, all right.


01:25:03.265 --> 01:25:04.599
I have a call in at Utica.


01:25:06.018 --> 01:25:07.685
- Utica?
- Her brother.


01:25:09.479 --> 01:25:12.398
Petty crimes mostly,
worse up through the years.


01:25:12.482 --> 01:25:16.193
He was transporting duffels
and got caught.


01:25:16.278 --> 01:25:19.155
Five years incarcerated at Utica.


01:25:19.239 --> 01:25:21.741
Same place Paul McKinney did time.


01:25:21.825 --> 01:25:24.493
That's too much of a coincidence.


01:25:24.578 --> 01:25:27.496
Her brother incarcerated
in the same place as...


01:25:28.498 --> 01:25:32.293
- What do they call him?
- Oh, the Mud Victim.


01:25:32.377 --> 01:25:36.380
See, that's poetry, Yale.


01:26:18.298 --> 01:26:19.548
Motherfucker.


01:26:33.689 --> 01:26:34.939
This Will do.


01:26:36.274 --> 01:26:38.859
We won't get far with her
if she feels threatened.


01:26:46.993 --> 01:26:49.328
- Oh, hi.
- Hey. How you doin'?


01:26:57.504 --> 01:26:59.463
Here you go, ma'am.


01:26:59.548 --> 01:27:00.673
All right.


01:27:52.517 --> 01:27:54.727
Let's get going. Thanks, Rose.


01:27:55.896 --> 01:27:58.731
- You okay, Sally?
- Fine.


01:27:58.815 --> 01:28:01.275
You sold your trailer?


01:28:02.944 --> 01:28:04.862
I'm gonna stay in the area, Sal.


01:28:04.946 --> 01:28:07.948
Dolly's passin' by too, just so you know,
in case you need anythin'.


01:28:10.952 --> 01:28:12.286
Where?


01:28:13.830 --> 01:28:15.164
He's out already?


01:28:16.625 --> 01:28:19.251
- What?
- I'll call you back.


01:28:20.545 --> 01:28:21.837
Fuck.


01:29:47.632 --> 01:29:50.009
Yeah, besides processing.


01:29:50.093 --> 01:29:53.220
Then check bank accounts,
insurance, I don't knoW.


01:29:53.305 --> 01:29:55.306
No, I'm not yelling at you,
David, I just-


01:29:55.390 --> 01:29:57.850
All right, just get back to me,
all right? With the record.


01:29:57.934 --> 01:30:01.145
Guy gave her cash for the trailer.
Doesn't know shit about her.


01:30:01.229 --> 01:30:03.898
He got out of the sick ward
a week ago. Taking a beating.


01:30:05.400 --> 01:30:06.650
Fuck.


01:30:07.652 --> 01:30:09.278
Fucking prisons.


01:30:09.362 --> 01:30:12.239
We lock 'em up, and we're just
creating a breeding ground.


01:30:39.935 --> 01:30:43.187
It's a long straight ball to center field!


01:30:43.271 --> 01:30:45.814
Home run!


01:30:51.821 --> 01:30:53.405
Oh, come here.


01:30:59.204 --> 01:31:01.789
Hey. What'd they do to you?


01:31:01.873 --> 01:31:05.292
Hey. Can't you smile anymore?


01:31:13.760 --> 01:31:16.178
Oh. Oh, Wow.


01:31:16.262 --> 01:31:19.306
She is- she is really young.


01:31:21.226 --> 01:31:22.810
When do we go meet 'em?


01:31:25.188 --> 01:31:29.358
Well, they told me bring her
out to the airfield about 11:00 o'clock.


01:31:38.994 --> 01:31:42.496
Here, here. Why don't you
have a seat right there?


01:31:56.636 --> 01:31:58.053
Remember that?


01:32:06.521 --> 01:32:08.230
I'm sorry I can't get you anything.


01:32:08.314 --> 01:32:10.524
You know, nobody's been here
for the past couple of years


01:32:10.608 --> 01:32:12.401
since... since our dad died.


01:32:12.485 --> 01:32:14.153
That's fine.


01:32:33.798 --> 01:32:35.549
That. Don't you touch that.


01:32:35.633 --> 01:32:37.676
Get your paws off my trophy.


01:32:57.072 --> 01:32:59.031
You know, I Was- I Was-


01:32:59.115 --> 01:33:00.991
I Was happy when you got away.


01:33:02.285 --> 01:33:03.410
- I was.
- I know.


01:33:07.040 --> 01:33:09.291
I didn't have to-
I didn't have to think about...


01:33:10.418 --> 01:33:13.462
listening to something happen
to you every night.


01:33:29.771 --> 01:33:31.855
It's not as bad as I thought.


01:33:33.691 --> 01:33:36.735
I mean, the mess is as bad
as I thought it'd be, but...


01:33:44.202 --> 01:33:45.452
It doesn't scare me anymore.


01:33:46.454 --> 01:33:47.996
Well, that's good to hear.


01:33:52.210 --> 01:33:55.420
Should we, should we get going?


01:33:55.505 --> 01:33:57.589
Sure. Where?


01:34:04.931 --> 01:34:06.431
You're right about me, you knoW.


01:34:09.018 --> 01:34:10.144
What?


01:34:11.479 --> 01:34:13.313
I knoW nothing about this.


01:34:16.025 --> 01:34:17.901
Grew up with a silver spoon.


01:34:19.028 --> 01:34:21.613
Completely disconnected.


01:34:21.698 --> 01:34:25.909
And the strongest memory I have of my mom
was her picture hanging above my crib.


01:34:27.579 --> 01:34:31.081
And I joined the Bureau so I could mean
something to someone.


01:34:32.959 --> 01:34:34.960
Can't say that's Working out.


01:34:38.381 --> 01:34:39.590
Why'd you join?


01:34:41.843 --> 01:34:43.635
Doesn't matter why I joined.


01:34:43.720 --> 01:34:46.013
Only matters what I do with it.


01:34:52.937 --> 01:34:53.979
Yeah.


01:34:55.148 --> 01:34:56.607
What?


01:34:56.691 --> 01:34:59.693
Yeah, okay. Yeah.


01:35:01.529 --> 01:35:04.573
Hospital has Sally on file.
Over 30 years ago.


01:35:04.657 --> 01:35:08.827
Numerous ER visits,
various, accidents.


01:35:08.912 --> 01:35:12.331
She was brought in by her brother.
There's a home address.


01:35:20.506 --> 01:35:24.092
I don't Wanna give her back.
I Wanna buy her out.


01:35:26.304 --> 01:35:29.014
- The girl?
- Leila, yeah.


01:35:31.935 --> 01:35:34.436
Well, what are you gonna do with her?


